    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0541_T11R0802_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hi! I heard that you\n",
        "lost your cherished Poké Doll.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: If I find it, you’ll give\n",
        "me a Magnet Train Pass?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I’ll go find it for you.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: You think you lost it\n",
        "when you went to Vermilion City?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
